    <body>
      <div type="work" n="116">
        <pb n="155"/>
        <head>116 — ii — IV. — <quote>Because it is he that made us and not we ourselves</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1"><persName>Christ</persName>, the Word of God, through whom everything<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> came into being and was established, who also created man in the beginning and set him to rule over all, in that he blessed him and said to him the words, <quote>Be fruitful and multiply and fill the earth and subdue it</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/>, he by becoming incarnate and becoming man of his own will [showed clearly<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/> that from the time of the crime of <persName>Herod</persName> and of the slaughter which he commanded against the children of <placeName>Bethlehem</placeName> in his madness he<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> converted this<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/> saying, <quote>Be fruitful and multiply and fill the earth</quote> and brought it and restored it to heaven. Let <pb n="156"/> us all therefore give diligence to enter into the calling [which leads to heaven<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a7" target="#n7" n="7"/>, praising his great mercy toward us.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 155, n. 6</orig></choice> Ps. c, 3, neither P nor LXX.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 155, n. 7</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>all things</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 155, n. 8</orig></choice> Gen. i, 27, 28 <quote>And God created..... blessed them and said to them..... earth.</quote></note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 155, n. 9</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>signified plainly</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 155, n. 10</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>that he</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 155, n. 11</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>the</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n7" target="#a7" n="7"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 156, n. 1</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>heavenly</quote>.</note>
      </noteGrp>
    </body>
